kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "yaml-dsl-project-config-schema"
purpose: "为项目级配置文件 `scalim.yaml` 提供自动生成的 JSON Schema，以获得与 demand/workflow 类似的编辑器补全与 schema-only 校验体验，并将其纳入同一条”SSOT → 生成物 → drift gate”的治理链路。 该 schema 仅描述 `scalim.yaml` 文件的结构，不改变 `scalim.yaml` 的可选性与 nearest-wins [scope-review-2026-07-12-c20]"
valid_scope[1]: src/scalim/
requirements[5]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,Project config MUST ship a canonical JSON Schema for `scalim.yaml`,"系统 MUST 提供 `scalim.yaml` 的 canonical JSON Schema 生成物，并将其随仓库提交，以供 IDE/LSP 离线绑定使用。 约束： - schema MUST 采用 JSON Schema Draft-07（与现有 demand/workflow schema 对齐） - schema 生成物 MUST 位于 schema 目录下（与现有 schema 同目录） - schema 生成物 MUST 包含 `$comment` 且明确其生成入口（避免误手改）"
  r2,`scalim.yaml` schema MUST validate the `yaml_dsl` section used by imports/discov,"`scalim.yaml` schema MUST 至少覆盖当前 runtime/editor 实际读取的配置面： - `yaml_dsl.import_roots` - `yaml_dsl.lsp.python_roots` - `yaml_dsl.lsp.kind_overrides` 并对关键类型做 schema-level fail-fast（在编辑器侧即可提示）。"
  r3,"Schema generation MUST reuse the existing YAML DSL schema pipeline and be drift-","系统 MUST 将 `scalim.yaml` schema 纳入现有 YAML DSL schema 生成管线与漂移门禁中： - SSOT MUST 位于 schema SSOT 目录（不得手写独立 JSON schema 作为 SSOT） - 生成入口 MUST 复用 schema 生成脚本 - 仓库 MUST 提供 drift gate（测试/脚本）确保生成结果与已提交生成物一致"
  r4,scalim.yaml schema generation MUST follow the same SSOT/tooling split as YAML DS,"系统 MUST 将 `scalim.yaml` 的 JSON Schema 生成遵循与 demand/workflow schema 相同的边界约束： - `scalim.yaml` schema 的结构/描述 SSOT MUST 位于 schema SSOT 目录 - 生成器实现 MUST 位于 dev tooling packages，并消费 core SSOT - 生成入口与生成物位置 MUST 仍由 schema 生成脚本统一负责"
  r5,`scalim.yaml` schema MUST reject runtime runner config,系统 MUST 将 `scalim.yaml` 的 `yaml_dsl` 段落限制为 imports + LSP/discovery 配置面，并且 MUST 拒绝任何 runtime runner defaults 配置（例如 `yaml_dsl.runner`）。
scenarios[11]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r1,"schema-artifact-is-present-and-references-the-generator",schema SSOT 已定义,维护者执行 schema 生成命令,schema 目录下 MUST 产出 `scalim.yaml` 的 schema 生成物
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r2,"invalid-types-are-rejected-by-schema-only-validation","",用户将 `yaml_dsl.import_roots` 写成非 list（例如 mapping/int）,"schema-only 校验 MUST 失败并指向 `yaml_dsl.import_roots`"
  r2,"kind-overrides-kind-is-constrained","","用户配置 `yaml_dsl.lsp.kind_overrides[0].kind: other`","schema-only 校验 MUST 失败"
  r3,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r3,"drift-is-detected",维护者修改了 schema SSOT 但未刷新生成物,执行仓库 QA/drift gate（例如 schema generation 测试）,"gate MUST fail-fast 并提示需要运行 schema 生成命令"
  r4,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r4,"scalim-yaml-generator-output-is-produced-by-the-unified-entr",schema SSOT 已定义,维护者执行 schema 生成命令,系统 MUST 同时生成/刷新 `scalim.yaml` 的 schema 生成物
  r5,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
  r5,"yaml-dsl-runner-is-rejected","",用户在 `scalim.yaml` 中配置 `yaml_dsl.runner.allowed_modules`,"schema-only 校验 MUST 失败并指向 `yaml_dsl.runner`"